OL,3,AMore than 170,000 respiratory cases
OL,4,Arecorded in haze-choked Indonesia
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndonesia has deployed more than 54,000
OL,7,Fofficials and dozens of jets to the
OL,8,Fislands of Borneo and Sumatra for water
OL,9,Fbombing, but the vast territory and
OL,10,Fchallenging peatland conditions make it
OL,11,Fhard to put out the fires, authorities
OL,12,Fsay.
